[TOPIC] Message summary

# Standardized Commit Message Convention for AutoInstaller
# Format: [TOPIC] Short imperative description (e.g. [FEAT] Add Brave mini-installer skeleton)
#
# Topics:
#   [FEAT]     - New features, new application installers, new tools
#   [FIX]      - Bug fixes, path corrections, detection updates
#   [CHORE]    - Maintenance, configuration files, gitignore, dependencies
#   [DOCS]     - Documentation changes (READMEs, catalog, architecture)
#   [TEST]     - Test suites, Au3Check validation runs, verification scripts
#   [REFACTOR] - Architecture and structural refactoring
